<h2 id="edit-content">Editing existing content</h2>
<h3>Change text</h3>
<p>Open the <code>.astro</code> file, edit text inside <code>&lt;p&gt;</code> and <code>&lt;h2&gt;</code> tags directly.</p>
<h3>Change a section label</h3>
<p>Edit text inside <code>&lt;p class="section-kicker"&gt;</code></p>
<h3>Swap an image</h3>
<p>Add the new image to <code>src/assets/images/</code>, update the import line at the top of the file. The HTML does not need to change — it references the variable name.</p>
<h3>Reorder homepage cards</h3>
<p>Reorder the objects in the <code>projects</code> array in <code>src/data/projects.ts</code>.</p>
<h3>Add a caption to an image</h3>
<pre><code>&lt;figure&gt;
  &lt;Image class="aside-img" src={myImage} alt="..."/&gt;
  &lt;figcaption&gt;Caption text&lt;/figcaption&gt;
&lt;/figure&gt;</code></pre>

<h2 id="css-classes">All CSS classes</h2>
<h4>Page wrapper</h4>
<p><code>case-page</code> — outer wrapper, sets max width and margins</p>
<h4>Hero</h4>
<p><code>case-hero</code> — top section with breadcrumb, title, intro</p>
<p><code>display-title</code> — large h1</p>
<p><code>hero-text</code> — intro paragraph</p>
<p><code>hero-subtext</code> — italic supporting line</p>
<h4>Meta strip</h4>
<p><code>meta-strip</code> — three-column grid (Scope, Role, Tools)</p>
<p><code>meta-label</code> — small caps label</p>
<p><code>meta-value</code> — bold value</p>
<h4>Labels</h4>
<p><code>section-kicker</code> — small caps label above a heading</p>
<h4>Content sections</h4>
<p><code>content-section</code> — two-column: 42rem content left, image right</p>
<p><code>content-section no-border</code> — no top border</p>
<p><code>section-content</code> — left column</p>
<p><code>section-image</code> — right column</p>
<p><code>aside-img</code> — right-column image</p>
<h4>Full-width images</h4>
<p><code>full-image-section</code> — wrapper with bottom border</p>
<p><code>full-image-section no-border</code> — no bottom border</p>
<p><code>full-image</code> — image class</p>
<p><code>lead-image-section</code> — hero image at top of page</p>
<p><code>lead-image</code> — lead image class</p>
<h4>Scroll galleries</h4>
<p><code>scroll-section</code> — wrapper</p>
<p><code>scroll-hint-label</code> — "Scroll to see more →"</p>
<p><code>image-scroll-track-wrap</code> — overflow container</p>
<p><code>image-scroll-track</code> — flex row</p>
<p><code>scroll-fig</code> — figure (380px wide)</p>
<p><code>scroll-fig large</code> — figure (560px wide)</p>
<p><code>scroll-img</code> — image (380x255px)</p>
<p><code>scroll-img large</code> — image (560x387px)</p>
<h4>Summary</h4>
<p><code>summary-section</code> — wide text block</p>
<p><code>summary-body</code> — text inside summary</p>

